      "fact": "and orders, search call it",
      "status": "stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "p99 rises first",
      "status": "not_stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "p50 usually stays flat until the problem spreads",
      "status": "not_stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Time spent waiting on postgres-primary grows faster than time spent in the service itself",
      "status": "not_stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Request rate is normal: this is slowness, not extra load",
      "status": "not_stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Garbage collection pauses are the most common cause on inventory",
      "status": "contradicted"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Garbage collection pauses explained 22 of the last 28 pages for this alert",
      "status": "stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Heap close to its limit makes collection pauses show up in p99",
      "status": "stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Slow dependency is a likely cause",
      "status": "not_stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Most latency is spent waiting on postgres-primary",
      "status": "stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "check its own latency first",
      "status": "stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Lock contention is a likely cause",
      "status": "not_stated"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Long-held row or mutex locks serialize requests under normal load",
